[I] Type constraints and coercions for Perl

[T] Specio is a type constraint library for Perl, providing declarative type
[T] constraints, coercions and a library of builtin types, used by DateTime
[T] and other modules to validate values.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Specio

